    "A keyed rail sends the conversation to that provider's servers. Taylor never uses one unless you agree to it, and agreement lasts only for that conversation.": {
      "comment": "Introduced by the Swift port; not present in the prototype.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A keyed rail sends the conversation to that provider's servers. Taylor never uses one unless you agree to it, and agreement lasts only for that conversation."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un riel con llave envía la conversación a los servidores de ese proveedor. Taylor nunca usa uno sin su consentimiento, y el consentimiento dura sólo esa conversación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A narrowed scope must name what it is narrowed to.": {
      "comment": "Introduced by the Swift port; not present in the prototype.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A narrowed scope must name what it is narrowed to."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un alcance restringido debe nombrar a qué se restringe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A person still decides. The agent recommends, and the chain records both the recommendation and the decision.": {
      "comment": "Introduced by the Swift port; not present in the prototype.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A person still decides. The agent recommends, and the chain records both the recommendation and the decision."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una persona sigue decidiendo. El agente recomienda, y la cadena registra tanto la recomendación como la decisión."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A store connector holds records locally when the link is down and replays them in order when it returns. A store showing no exceptions while its connector is offline has not been checked; it has not reported.": {
      "comment": "Introduced by the Swift port; not present in the prototype.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A store connector holds records locally when the link is down and replays them in order when it returns. A store showing no exceptions while its connector is offline has not been checked; it has not reported."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El conector de la tienda guarda los registros localmente cuando el enlace cae y los reenvía en orden cuando vuelve. Una tienda sin excepciones mientras su conector está sin conexión no ha sido revisada; no ha reportado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A store-scoped agent has its own store identifier, permitted records, unresolved cases and escalation contacts; shared models do its work when an event arrives or someone asks. One agent per scope, never thousands of models.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A store-scoped agent has its own store identifier, permitted records, unresolved cases and escalation contacts; shared models do its work when an event arrives or someone asks. One agent per scope, never thousands of models."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un agente con alcance de tienda tiene su propio identificador, registros permitidos, casos sin resolver y contactos de escalación; los modelos compartidos hacen su trabajo cuando llega un evento o alguien pregunta. Un agente por alcance, nunca miles de modelos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A store-scoped agent is a permission boundary, not a model. Every scoped agent in the estate runs on the same shared model services; scoping decides what it may read and act on, not what it thinks with.": {
      "comment": "Introduced by the Swift port; not present in the prototype.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A store-scoped agent is a permission boundary, not a model. Every scoped agent in the estate runs on the same shared model services; scoping decides what it may read and act on, not what it thinks with."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un agente con alcance de tienda es un límite de permisos, no un modelo. Todos los agentes con alcance del parque operan sobre los mismos servicios de modelo compartidos; el alcance decide qué puede leer y sobre qué puede actuar, no con qué piensa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
