            "value": "Cada registro aquí prueba que lo registrado no fue alterado después. No prueba que todo haya sido registrado; el auditor verifica la completitud por su cuenta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every figure on this screen comes from the prototype's seed and is labeled sample data until the pilot measures it. Benchmarks: Ardent Partners 2025 (cost per invoice, exceptions, cycle time, touchless), APQC and IOFM (duplicate payments), dated September 2026.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every figure on this screen comes from the prototype's seed and is labeled sample data until the pilot measures it. Benchmarks: Ardent Partners 2025 (cost per invoice, exceptions, cycle time, touchless), APQC and IOFM (duplicate payments), dated September 2026."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada cifra en esta pantalla proviene de la semilla del prototipo y lleva la etiqueta datos de muestra hasta que el piloto la mida. Referencias: Ardent Partners 2025 (costo por factura, excepciones, ciclo, sin toque), APQC e IOFM (pagos duplicados), con fecha de septiembre de 2026."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every figure on this screen is an estimate from manufacturer specifications and published tests, not a measurement of this cluster. Phase 0 burn-in replaces it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every figure on this screen is an estimate from manufacturer specifications and published tests, not a measurement of this cluster. Phase 0 burn-in replaces it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada cifra en esta pantalla es una estimación a partir de especificaciones del fabricante y pruebas publicadas, no una medición de este clúster. La prueba de fuego de la Fase 0 la reemplaza."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every reply records the rail that produced it and whether it left this machine. A reply with no provenance is a defect, not an omission.": {
      "comment": "Introduced by the Swift port; not present in the prototype.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every reply records the rail that produced it and whether it left this machine. A reply with no provenance is a defect, not an omission."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada respuesta registra el riel que la produjo y si salió de esta máquina. Una respuesta sin procedencia es un defecto, no una omisión."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every seal is recomputed from the event it covers and the seal before it. A mismatch names the first event that does not hold.": {
      "comment": "Introduced by the Swift port; not present in the prototype.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every seal is recomputed from the event it covers and the seal before it. A mismatch names the first event that does not hold."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada sello se recalcula a partir del evento que cubre y del sello anterior. Una discrepancia señala el primer evento que no se sostiene."
          }
        }
      }
    },
