            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GPU engine needs WebGPU (Safari on iPadOS 26 and macOS 26, Chrome, Edge); without it the CPU engine runs a smaller model, slower. Both need outside scripts allowed: Claude's preview window blocks them, Safari does not."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El motor GPU requiere WebGPU (Safari en iPadOS 26 y macOS 26, Chrome, Edge); sin él, el motor CPU corre un modelo más pequeño, más lento. Ambos requieren scripts externos: la ventana de vista previa de Claude los bloquea, Safari no."
          }
        }
      }
    },
