    "Store count alone never sets the number of clusters. Every site carries the same hardware and infrastructure rules as the bank's rack: octets of eight plus an admin node, Thunderbolt 5 with RDMA inside the octet, the enterprise's internal network between sites.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Store count alone never sets the number of clusters. Every site carries the same hardware and infrastructure rules as the bank's rack: octets of eight plus an admin node, Thunderbolt 5 with RDMA inside the octet, the enterprise's internal network between sites."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El número de tiendas por sí solo nunca fija el número de clústeres. Cada sitio sigue las mismas reglas de hardware e infraestructura que el rack del banco: octetos de ocho más un nodo administrador, Thunderbolt 5 con RDMA dentro del octeto, la red interna de la empresa entre sitios."
          }
        }
      }
    },
