    "Taylor is named after the quant in Billions: a temperament Martin recognized, and a craft he practiced at the highest level. The intention is for Taylor to grow into an AI of her own on this stack; Bridge is where she first speaks.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Taylor is named after the quant in Billions: a temperament Martin recognized, and a craft he practiced at the highest level. The intention is for Taylor to grow into an AI of her own on this stack; Bridge is where she first speaks."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Taylor lleva el nombre de la quant de Billions: un temperamento que Martin reconoció, y un oficio que él ejerció al más alto nivel. La intención es que Taylor crezca hasta ser una IA propia sobre esta pila; Bridge es donde habla por primera vez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
