    "The CFDI is cancelled at the SAT. Nothing on it can be paid or credited; route to central finance.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The CFDI is cancelled at the SAT. Nothing on it can be paid or credited; route to central finance."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El CFDI está cancelado ante el SAT. Nada de él puede pagarse ni acreditarse; enviar a finanzas central."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The CFDI is not in force at the SAT. Hold and confirm its status before any payment.": {
      "comment": "Introduced by the Swift port; not present in the prototype.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The CFDI is not in force at the SAT. Hold and confirm its status before any payment."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El CFDI no está vigente ante el SAT. Retener y confirmar su estatus antes de cualquier pago."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The RFC does not match the supplier of record. Route to the regional team before anything else.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The RFC does not match the supplier of record. Route to the regional team before anything else."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El RFC no coincide con el proveedor registrado. Enviar al equipo regional antes que nada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The UPS covers the seconds between losing one source and settling on another. It is a bridge, not a supply, and its rating is stated in minutes at the rack's steady load.": {
      "comment": "Introduced by the Swift port; not present in the prototype.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The UPS covers the seconds between losing one source and settling on another. It is a bridge, not a supply, and its rating is stated in minutes at the rack's steady load."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El UPS cubre los segundos entre la pérdida de una fuente y la estabilización en otra. Es un puente, no un suministro, y su capacidad se expresa en minutos a la carga constante del rack."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent sees every account in its division. Use this only where the work genuinely spans them.": {
      "comment": "Introduced by the Swift port; not present in the prototype.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The agent sees every account in its division. Use this only where the work genuinely spans them."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El agente ve todas las cuentas de su división. Úselo sólo donde el trabajo realmente las abarque."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent sees one delivery route and the stores on it.": {
      "comment": "Introduced by the Swift port; not present in the prototype.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The agent sees one delivery route and the stores on it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El agente ve una ruta de entrega y las tiendas que están en ella."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent sees one store's records. Twenty-four thousand scoped agents share the same model services; they are not twenty-four thousand models.": {
      "comment": "Introduced by the Swift port; not present in the prototype.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The agent sees one store's records. Twenty-four thousand scoped agents share the same model services; they are not twenty-four thousand models."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El agente ve los registros de una tienda. Veinticuatro mil agentes con alcance comparten los mismos servicios de modelo; no son veinticuatro mil modelos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent sees one supplier across the stores that buy from it.": {
      "comment": "Introduced by the Swift port; not present in the prototype.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The agent sees one supplier across the stores that buy from it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El agente ve un proveedor a través de las tiendas que le compran."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The array feeds the rack first and the bank second. When the bank is full and the array is still making more than the rack needs, the surplus is clipped rather than stored.": {
      "comment": "Introduced by the Swift port; not present in the prototype.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The array feeds the rack first and the bank second. When the bank is full and the array is still making more than the rack needs, the surplus is clipped rather than stored."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El arreglo alimenta primero al rack y después al banco. Cuando el banco está lleno y el arreglo sigue generando más de lo que el rack necesita, el excedente se recorta en lugar de almacenarse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The authenticator neither confirmed nor refused, so nothing was approved. An ambiguous timeout is never permission to pay again.": {
      "comment": "Introduced by the Swift port; not present in the prototype.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The authenticator neither confirmed nor refused, so nothing was approved. An ambiguous timeout is never permission to pay again."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El autenticador no confirmó ni rechazó, por lo que no se aprobó nada. Un tiempo de espera ambiguo nunca es permiso para pagar de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The authenticator refused.": {
      "comment": "Introduced by the Swift port; not present in the prototype.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The authenticator refused."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El autenticador rechazó."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bank is full and the array is making more than the rack needs, so the surplus is being clipped.": {
      "comment": "Introduced by the Swift port; not present in the prototype.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bank is full and the array is making more than the rack needs, so the surplus is being clipped."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El banco está lleno y el arreglo genera más de lo que el rack necesita, por lo que el excedente se está recortando."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bank record and the invoice disagree. Reconcile before any further payment.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bank record and the invoice disagree. Reconcile before any further payment."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El registro bancario y la factura no coinciden. Conciliar antes de cualquier pago adicional."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bank record does not equal the invoice amount. Flag the mismatch and reconcile before anything further is paid.": {
      "comment": "Introduced by the Swift port; not present in the prototype.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
