        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El emisor aparece en la lista 69-B. Reunir la evidencia de la recepción efectiva dentro de treinta días o se pierde el efecto fiscal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The issuer is on the 69-B list. Gather receiving evidence within thirty days so the fiscal effect is preserved; hold payment.": {
