    "The reserve floor is not available power. It is what the bank keeps back so that an unplanned transfer has something to draw on, which is why autonomy counts only what sits above it.": {
      "comment": "Introduced by the Swift port; not present in the prototype.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The reserve floor is not available power. It is what the bank keeps back so that an unplanned transfer has something to draw on, which is why autonomy counts only what sits above it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El piso de reserva no es energía disponible. Es lo que el banco retiene para que una transferencia imprevista tenga de dónde tomar, y por eso la autonomía cuenta sólo lo que está por encima de él."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The seal": {
      "comment": "Introduced by the Swift port; not present in the prototype.",
