    },
    "Weights, plus headroom for the conversation to grow. On a machine with 16 GB the risk is not a refusal to load but memory pressure mid-answer, so the smaller model is the right choice when the machine is already busy.": {
      "comment": "Introduced by the Swift port; not present in the prototype.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Weights, plus headroom for the conversation to grow. On a machine with 16 GB the risk is not a refusal to load but memory pressure mid-answer, so the smaller model is the right choice when the machine is already busy."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pesos, más margen para que la conversación crezca. En una máquina de 16 GB el riesgo no es que se niegue a cargar, sino la presión de memoria a media respuesta, por lo que el modelo pequeño es la opción correcta cuando la máquina ya está ocupada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
